{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p000884","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p000884"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p000884","label":"陳武（漢初大將軍）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"陳武","mention_ids":["c-shiji-010-wendi:m003-0122","c-shiji-010-wendi:m022-0037"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m003-0122","chapter_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:p003","quote":"陳武"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m022-0037","chapter_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:p022","quote":"陳武"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m003-0122","start":122,"end":124,"surface":"陳武","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000884","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:p003","chapter_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m022-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"陳武","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000884","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:p022","chapter_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:p003","text":"昌至渭橋，丞相以下皆迎。宋昌還報。代王馳至渭橋，群臣拜謁稱臣。代王下車拜。太尉勃進曰：「願請閒言。」宋昌曰：「所言公，公言之。所言私，王者不受私。」太尉乃跪上天子璽符。代王謝曰：「至代邸而議之。」遂馳入代邸。群臣從至。丞相陳平、太尉周勃、大將軍陳武、御史大夫張蒼、宗正劉郢、朱虛侯劉章、東牟侯劉興居、典客劉揭皆再拜言曰：「子弘等皆非孝惠帝子，不當奉宗廟。臣謹請（與）陰安侯列侯頃王后與瑯邪王、宗室、大臣、列侯、吏二千石議曰：『大王高帝長子，宜為高帝嗣。』願大王即天子位。」代王曰：「奉高帝宗廟，重事也。寡人不佞，不足以稱宗廟。願請楚王計宜者，寡人不敢當。」群臣皆伏固請。代王西鄉讓者三，南鄉讓者再。丞相平等皆曰：「臣伏計之，大王奉高帝宗廟最宜稱，雖天下諸侯萬民以為宜。臣等為宗廟社稷計，不敢忽。願大王幸聽臣等。臣謹奉天子璽符再拜上。」代王曰：「宗室將相王列侯以為莫宜寡人，寡人不敢辭。」遂即天子位。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m003-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"宋昌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000881","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m003-0017","start":17,"end":19